[0m[0m
- Symbol gate: built the C [38;5;10m.so[0m with gcc, [38;5;10mnm -D --defined-only[0m on both. 16 exports each, [38;5;10mcomm[0m/[38;5;10mdiff[0m of the sorted lists is empty in both directions.[0m[0m
